      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HARRY (3) has been well held in 1000m races since finishing a close fourth three back over 800m at Narromine. Meets a very plain line-up here so from a good gate he should find his best form which will be good enough. BADGERS BRIDGE (4) has high-balled in front at her last two outings and given plenty of cheek, the pick of those runs a narrow defeat over 1000m at Warren on 21 July. Sure to give a tremendous sight coming back to 900m. LOVELY LENI (6) was in the market and raced handy but couldn't go on with the job on debut recently over 1000m at Dubbo. Expect she has a lot more to offer than that. Market watch on BEST DEFENCE (1) first-up since April 2025. Usually needs a run to find form but a recent trial at Gilgandra was encouraging. MAZORT (10) last appeared when midfield in the Wellington Boot in April. No surprise if he was able to stretch this field.",
